            "review_title": "Review at Pizza 4P's Le Dai Hanh",
            "review_text": "Kov K\n1 contribution\n0\n5/5 stars for them.\nDec 2023 • Family\nThis is amazing place for lunch. With many cars parking slots. All staffs are very nice and careful look after us.\nIn my opinion, LDH is the best store of 4p in Saigon. Because LDH store is next to starbucks and lotte supermarket, you can go coffee or shopping after lunch.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 3, 2023\nPizza 4P's Guest Service\nDear Mr/Ms. Kov K,\n\nThank you very much for your feedback at Pizza 4P's Le Thanh Ton.\n\nWe really appreciate and are interested in the experience you have had at our restaurant.\nYour compliments and affection for the staff and food of the restaurant are a great motivation for Pizza 4P's to continue to try harder, to bring customers the best quality of service.\n\nWe are really thankful for your reviews, and wish you a nice day. 🤗💙\nTeam Pizza 4P's\nRead more\nWritten December 4, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
