            "review_text": "Jenny\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam11 contributions\n0\nWonderful\nNov 2023 • Friends\nI want to thank the 4P team for surprising me on my birthday. Food so delicious and amazing service. Highly recommended!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 24, 2023\nPizza 4P's Guest Service\nDear Mr/Ms. Jenny_90tg,\n\nThank you very much for your feedback at Pizza 4P's Le Thanh Ton.\n\nWe really appreciate and are interested in the experience you have had at our restaurant.\nYour compliments and affection for the staff and food of the restaurant is a great motivation for Pizza 4P's to continue to try harder, to bring customers the best quality of service.\n\nWe are really thankful for your reviews, and wish you a nice day. 🤗💙\nTeam Pizza 4P's\nRead more\nWritten November 25, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
