            "review_title": "Review at Pizza 4P's Le Dai Hanh",
            "review_text": "ZEUS\n4 contributions\n0\nAmazing Food, Service and Location with Pizza 4P (as always)\nFeb 2023 • Friends\nWe have visited a number of the Pizza 4P restaurants in Vietnam. \n\nThis was our first to this location and everything was of the high standard we have come to expect. \n\nWe were placed at a table of our choice quickly and the Pizzas were perfect - and consistent with all of the franchise venues. \n\nIt is also key to note that the price is very reasonable for such high quality foods. \n\nA special shoutout to Miss Thảo who was managing the staff with professional excellence, whilst seamlessly taking time to also meet and greet the customers, making us all feel most comfortable and welcome.\nRead more\nWritten February 20, 2023\nPizza 4P's\nDear Zeus A,\n\nThank you very much for your feedback at Pizza 4P's.\n\nWe really appreciated and are interested in the experience you have had at our restaurant.\nYour compliments and affection for the staff, space, and food of the restaurant is a great motivation for Pizza 4P's to continue to try harder, to bring customers the best quality of service.\n\nWe are really thankful for your reviews and wish you a nice day. 💙\nTeam Pizza 4P's\nRead more\nWritten February 21, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
