            "review_title": "Review at Pizza 4P's Le Dai Hanh",
            "review_text": "Klaus K\nBerlin, Germany40 contributions\n0\nDouble check everything\nJun 2022 • Couples\nWe ordered two dishes and two drinks. They served one of the dishes and told us after 40 minutes, after having asked about the Econ’s one, that that dish is not available. AFTER 30 MINUTES!\nWritten June 17, 2022\nPizza 4P's\nDear klausk201,\n\nMy name is Phuong Thanh, Senior Restaurant Manager of Pizza 4P's. I am currently in charge of Pizza 4P's Le Dai Hanh branch. \nThank you very much for coming to our store and giving us your feedback. \nI am sincerely sorry for your unpleasant dine-in experience yesterday. We take this incident very seriously, it is a breakdown of service procedure execution. \nThe partner did not get your order correctly and repeated it at the end, which causes the mistake to happen. We will train the service team more to follow the service process as well as the recovery action should have done better. \nOnce again, My apology for this unexpected incident. We would like to invite you to come to visit next time to see our improvement by the gift voucher link. Would you mind giving us your email address: feedback@pizza4ps.com then we can send you in private.\nThank you very much for your big feedback, we will try our best to improve our service quality.\nHave a nice evening!\n\nThanh\nRead more\nWritten June 18, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
