            "review_text": "Khloe\n12 contributions\n0\nService going down by day\nMar 2022 • Friends\nThere is no complain about the food cause taste still remain the same. By the way service is going down day by day clearly.\nCome for a lunch at 11am. After opening the door. All the staffs were standing at the bar. They turned over and saw us. Then back to chit chat with no attention and welcoming. As coming from a long distance we quickly take a table instead of choosing another place.\nWaitress came w a menu and go did not come back to ask if we ready to order or not. Restaurant status were not busy. I can see a lot of staff just hang around just to chit chat to each others,fixing the hair blah blah.\nAfter calling for few times. A waitress came to out table to take order. We request salad served the same time with main course. After reconfirming w us. Food still being served separately . LOL\nI can pay understanding for a busy restaurant with busy staff but not for this case.\nRestaurant under Japanese management but the grooming of the staff should be reviewed. Aprons so creasy. Hair is not tidy as well\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 7, 2022\nPizza 4P's\nDear Huỳnh K, My name is Phuong Thanh - Restaurant Manager of Pizza 4P's Le Dai Hanh. \nThank you very much for coming to our restaurant and giving us valuable feedback. We sincerely apologize for the unsatisfactory experience. As a Manager of a restaurant, I feel so guilty for the unprofessional appearance and unwelcoming service that my team has shown you yesterday. This is not a level of hospitality that we would provide. And it is absolutely my responsibility. Right after getting your feedback, I have had a meeting with the service management team to review and seriously couching my partner to not let it happen again. About the grooming, we will place an order of new uniforms for some partners that has not had enough quality, also strictly review again the uniform controlling process to make it better. Once again, thank you very much for your valuable feedback. We will try our best to improve it as soon as possible. Hope you will give us a chance by coming back next time and enjoying yourself with your friends and family.\nKind regards\nThanh\nRead more\nWritten March 8, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
